+
+This local DSH adapter is tested against `0.2.2-rc.1`, as declared in `engines.dsh`.
+Run `npm run test:dsh` with the installed DSH CLI available on `PATH` to check the adapter,
+conditional tool registration, configuration refresh, and cancellation contracts offline.
+The tests use temporary configuration and simulated memory requests.
+
+The adapter exports `createDshRuntime()` for the local `dsh-hindsight-manager` integration.
+Each runtime owns its workspace cache and hooks. After saving memory configuration, the manager
+refreshes that runtime before reporting success, so subsequent calls resolve the saved bank and
+server for their session workspace. Calls already in progress retain the configuration with which
+they began. Runtime disposal releases session references and drains outstanding transcript writes.
+The existing session snapshot reader remains on the host's deprecated API; migrating that reader
+to a session projection is separate from these compatibility fixes.
 
